The dependency provides firmware record codecs, sparse image operations and
CRC helpers. MoonFirmware adds target policy, NOR sector update planning,
protection checks, preimage validation and offline simulation. Upstream code
is obtained through Mooncakes; it is not copied or vendored in this repository.
